  "releaseNotes": "同步升级依赖NewLife.XCode 12.3；升级SQLite原生库System.Data.SQLite 2.0.4与SourceGear.sqlite3 3.53.4；修复无DataAdapter驱动下的数据集查询与SQLite备份兼容；支持DbCommand.ToString作为SQL预览输出；增强FieldExtension.Between区间查询能力；优化批量Update与Upsert SQL生成逻辑",
